# The edge node is a public ingress point: 80/443 (and WireGuard on
# 51820/udp) are open to the internet by design. There is no SSH.
AVD-AWS-0107
# Egress to anywhere is needed for SSM, apt, ACME and the tunnel.
AVD-AWS-0104
# VPC flow logs are skipped on the single-instance edge VPC to keep costs down.
AVD-AWS-0178
# Bucket access logging is not enabled (it would need another bucket); CloudTrail covers management events.
AVD-AWS-0089
